Plugin overlays
---------------

extras/plugins/clock and extras/plugins/network are modified copies of the
first-party Omarchy clock and network shell plugins.

  Author: Omarchy / Basecamp
  License: MIT
  https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy

This theme rewrites the clone id to <user>.clock / <user>.network at apply
time and adds a Launch Library 2 calendar plus a Starlink SSID easter egg.

Launch data is fetched at runtime from The Space Devs Launch Library 2
(https://ll.thespacedevs.com/) and cached under ~/.cache/omarchy-spacex/.
It is not shipped in this repository.

Lock Screen Explorer (https://github.com/SirJul1337/omarchy-lock-explorer)
is a recommended third-party plugin. apply-identity.sh installs it from that
upstream URL when it is missing; this repository does not vendor its code.
